View Assist EV toggles a thin vertical meter fixed at the feed’s left edge in DISP 1. It reads camera metering directly, with no image analysis. Check Auto, Manual and rotation; DISP 2 and playback hide it. Motion Control loops through saved zooms with Pause/Resume and Restart; D-Log2 blocks zoom changes. DE-SQ offers lens presets and a custom factor for live view, videos and photos. Preview recovery handles lost video format.
